https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

@startuml

!pragma teoz true
skinparam roundcorner 10
hide footbox

'title "Synchronous Request-Reply over Asynchronous Messaging"

autonumber

box "Zeebe" #FFF3E6
participant "Zeebe\npartition" as PartitionA
participant "Message\nsubscription" as MessageSubscription
end box

participant "Process\nsolution" as ProcessSolution

box "Kafka" #EDF4FE
queue "Request\ntopic" as RequestTopic
queue "Reply\ntopic" as ReplyTopic
end box

participant "External\nsystem" as ExternalSystem

activate PartitionA

PartitionA -->> ProcessSolution --++ : ActivatedJob

ProcessSolution ->> RequestTopic ++ : Publish request message
RequestTopic -->> ProcessSolution : Acknowledgement

ProcessSolution ->> PartitionA --++ : Complete job

create MessageSubscription
PartitionA ->> MessageSubscription -- : Create

RequestTopic ->> ExternalSystem --++ : Request consumed
ExternalSystem ->> ReplyTopic --++ : Reply produced
ReplyTopic -->> ProcessSolution --++ : Reply message
ProcessSolution ->> MessageSubscription : Publish reply message
destroy MessageSubscription
deactivate ProcessSolution

@enduml